<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;">A postcard went to print today</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;color:#52525b;line-height:1.6;">
  The card for <strong style="color:#18181b;">{{postcard.recipientName}}</strong> at {{postcard.address}} has gone to the printer.
  {{#if postcard.expectedDelivery}}It should arrive around <strong style="color:#18181b;">{{postcard.expectedDelivery}}</strong>.{{else}}It should arrive within about a week.{{/if}}
</p>
{{#if postcard.proofUrl}}
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;color:#52525b;line-height:1.6;">
  <a href="{{postcard.proofUrl}}" style="color:#18181b;">See a proof of the printed card</a>
</p>
{{/if}}
<p style="margin:16px 0 0;">
  <a href="{{order.trackingUrl}}" style="color:#18181b;">Follow the rest of this order</a>
</p>
